+ *   - 2x USB-A behind a USB3 hub (combphy1 + u2phy1)
+ *   - USB-C with PD/altmode (FUSB302 on i2c0, combphy0 + USBDP PHY)
+ *   - M.2 PCIe 2.0 x1 slot (combphy0 as PCIe lane)
+ *   - microSD card slot
